    "More pages": "更多頁面",
    "The zyx.tw theme on top of stock shadcn/ui: full grayscale palette, a 1rem radius, pure black dark mode, muted text at 4.5:1 on every surface in both themes, frosted transparent overlays, and a strict 24/16/14px interface type scale plus 80px display text. Init with the base preset and neutral color, then add this.": "zyx.tw 在原版 shadcn/ui 上使用的樣式：完整灰階色盤、1rem 圓角、純黑深色模式、兩種外觀皆達 4.5:1 的次要文字對比、透明模糊浮層，以及 24／16／14px 介面字級與 80px 展示字級。以 Base 預設和 neutral 色彩初始化後，再加入此樣式。",
    "Text with a shimmer sweeping across it, for loading and streaming states. CSS-only, zero dependencies, respects reduced motion.": "帶有掃光效果的文字，適合載入與串流狀態。純 CSS，無額外相依套件，遵循減少動態效果設定。",
    "Light/dark switcher for next-themes: a ghost icon button with a hydration-safe icon.": "適用 next-themes 的明暗外觀切換按鈕，圖示可安全進行 hydration。",
    "Random glyphs resolve into the final text from left to right, 50ms per character by default, on mount or in view. The text itself never leaves the flow, so the element keeps its display, line breaks and size; glyphs are aria-hidden and unselectable, and reduced motion shows the text at once. Zero dependencies.": "隨機字形由左至右逐步還原文字，預設每字 50ms，可在載入或進入畫面時觸發。原文字維持排版尺寸；動態字形不供輔助工具讀取或選取。減少動態效果時直接顯示完整文字，無額外相依套件。",
    "Cycles through words every 3.2s with a scramble or fade, controlled or uncontrolled. Reserves the widest word's box so the layout never shifts, pauses while the tab is hidden or on demand, and never auto-advances under reduced motion.": "每 3.2 秒以亂碼或淡入方式輪替文字，支援受控與非受控模式。預留最寬文字的空間以維持排版；分頁隱藏或手動暫停時停止，減少動態效果時不自動輪替。",
    "Reveals its children from left to right with a smoothstep-feathered gradient mask, after a 1s delay over 5s. The mask exists only while the keyframes play, so rings and shadows are intact afterwards. CSS only; reduced motion shows the content at once.": "等待 1 秒後，以柔邊漸層遮罩在 5 秒內由左至右揭示內容。動畫結束即移除遮罩，保留外框與陰影。純 CSS，減少動態效果時立即顯示內容。",
    "An Ask AI pill that opens the page in ChatGPT, Claude or Google AI Mode with a prompt, copies the prompt for any other AI, and copies or opens a Markdown version of the page. Sends the canonical URL, never the query or fragment. Composes the stock dropdown-menu and button.": "開啟 ChatGPT、Claude 或 Google AI Mode，並帶入頁面網址與提示詞；也能複製提示詞供其他 AI 使用，或複製、開啟 Markdown 版本。只傳送標準網址，不含查詢參數或錨點，以原版選單與按鈕組成。",
    "Text that glows brighter than SDR white on HDR displays in dark mode, from a 309-byte PQ BT.2020 AVIF clipped to its own glyphs. No layout change anywhere; SDR screens render a plain span. Optional hover mode fades back over 2s.": "在深色模式的 HDR 螢幕上，讓文字亮於 SDR 白色。將 309 位元組的 PQ BT.2020 AVIF 裁切為字形，不改變排版；SDR 螢幕顯示一般文字。可選擇在懸停後以 2 秒淡回原狀。",
